        "alinti": "GitHub Actions workflows don't run on a pull request until a user with write access approves them",
        "kaynak": "https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/security-governance-and-network-settings/risks-and-mitigations#automations-run-without-a-person-initiating-each-task"
      }
    },
